/* Security headers for Cloudflare Pages.
   A strict Content-Security-Policy is intentionally NOT set here: ad networks load
   third-party scripts, and a CSP must be written against the exact domains in your
   verified Adsterra code. Add one yourself after you have your ad code. */
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
